    'ecos.meta.titulo': 'Ecos de un futuro pasado · Mireia Gutiérrez Águila',
    'ecos.meta.desc': 'Ecos de un futuro pasado: a 3D platformer made with Godot in a 6-day jam, for Windows, macOS, Linux and Android, by Mireia Gutiérrez Águila.',
    'ecos.portada.alt': 'Cover of Ecos: the title "Ecos" in yellow letters next to the protagonist, a girl with lilac hair and a green dress, on a green background',
    'ecos.h.explica': 'About the game',
    'ecos.p1': 'This 3D platformer was created with Godot during a 6-day jam, the GameJam – V Jornadas de creación digital y videojuegos de Navarra (theme: "Legacy and future"). It stars a girl who wants to find out who she really is. In the introduction, several sentences appear inside speech bubbles of different colours. The player must read them and remember the colour of the ones they identify with most, because during the game they will have to collect the bubbles of the chosen colour and avoid those of the opposite colours, which represent thoughts they do not identify with.',
    'ecos.p2': 'At the end of the course, the protagonist walks through a door of time that shows her destiny. Depending on the colours of the bubbles collected, the player will see their future and turn into a descendant of one of two mythical characters: Princess Irati or Witch Mari.',
    'ecos.h.final': 'Characters in the final scene',
    'ecos.h.a': 'Option A: Princess Irati 👸🏼',
    'ecos.a1': 'If the number of lilac, yellow and light green bubbles is higher, the protagonist becomes a descendant of Princess Irati, for having chosen sentences linked to a more traditional way of thinking.',
    'ecos.qa': 'Who is Princess Irati?',
    'ecos.a2': 'Princess Irati was a renowned figure among royalty, a symbol of purity of soul and the light that guides righteous hearts. She believes in goodness, order and the beauty of the world. She tends to value order, individual responsibility and stability.',
    'ecos.h.b': 'Option B: Witch Mari 🧙🏼',
    'ecos.b1': 'If the number of turquoise, red and blue bubbles is higher, the protagonist becomes a descendant of Witch Mari, for having chosen thoughts associated with a more progressive and free outlook.',
    'ecos.qb': 'Who is Witch Mari?',
    'ecos.b2': 'In Basque mythology, Mari is the mother goddess, the lady of nature and considered the queen of witches. She creates, destroys and is reborn, reminding us that true power comes from thinking for oneself. She thinks, feels and acts for herself.',
    'ecos.h.estrategia': 'Game strategy',
    'ecos.p3': 'The design aims to convey a symbolic message: if the player takes the easiest and safest path, they will end up becoming a princess, reflecting how following a more traditional outlook can seem simple and stable. In contrast, reaching the witch\'s path, associated with progress and freedom of thought, takes more effort, reflection and action, showing that evolving also takes courage.',
    'ecos.h.valor': 'Assessment of the result',
    'ecos.p4': 'The game was made to take part in a 6-day jam. As the designer and developer of the project, I am satisfied with the final result. I am aware that it is a simple game, but I consider the achievement significant given my starting point. I am not a trained programmer: my previous experience is limited to a PHP course I took about seven years ago and a short one in JavaScript, without ever having worked professionally in programming. I currently work as a manual QA Tester. I started learning Godot barely a week ago, following a tutorial, and I had never worked with Blender or any similar 3D modelling program before. For all these reasons, I am really happy and proud of the result.',
    'ecos.h.assets': 'Assets used',
    'ecos.as.musica': 'Background music:',
    'ecos.as.princesa': 'Princess song:',
    'ecos.as.bruja': 'Witch song:',
    'ecos.as.sonido': 'Bubble pick-up sound:',
    'ecos.as.cielo': 'Sky code (modified by me):',
    'ecos.h.nombre': 'Where the name comes from',
    'ecos.p5': 'The name of the game is the title of a song by the band Los Chicos del Maíz. The song\'s subject is not directly related to the game, but I really like the band and many of their lyrics are social criticism. Here is the link in case you want to listen to it.',
    'ecos.spotify': 'Listen on Spotify',
    'ecos.ia': 'No generative AI was used in Ecos, as I state on itch.io. This website, on the other hand, was built by directing an AI step by step.',
    'mitocat.meta.titulo': 'MitoCat · Mireia Gutiérrez Águila',
    'mitocat.meta.desc': 'MitoCat: ten minigames based on Catalan mythology legends, for Windows, macOS and Linux, made with Unity by Mireia Gutiérrez Águila.',
    'mitocat.portada.alt': 'MitoCat poster, "Catalan legends - 10 minigames", with a row of Catalan mythology characters in front of a dark forest',
    'mitocat.p1': 'Discover the magic of Catalan mythology with MitoCat.',
    'mitocat.p2': 'We all know Sant Jordi, the Caga Tió or the Castanyera, right? But what about the Pesanta, the Molsosa or the Cocollona? Through MitoCat you can find out who these characters and many others are, living their legends in the first person.',
    'mitocat.h.que': 'What is MitoCat?',
    'mitocat.p3': 'It is a collection of ten unique minigames, one for each legend. I wanted to explore different mechanics and styles to put my learning to the test: you will find 3D and 2D games, first- and third-person perspectives, shooter mechanics, flying, swimming, magic and much more. From soaring over the skies of Girona with the Cocollona to escaping the shadows with Comte Estruch himself.',
    'mitocat.h.proyecto': 'About the project',
    'mitocat.p4': 'I\'m Mireia, and MitoCat is the project through which I learned to program in Unity from scratch. The wide variety of styles in the levels is no accident: my goal was to learn as much as possible about different game mechanics during my training.',
    'mitocat.h.gracias': 'Acknowledgements',
    'mitocat.p5': 'This learning journey would not have been possible without the support of some amazing people:',
    'mitocat.li1': 'To @LuisCanary, for guiding me from the basics with his Unity tutorials.',
    'mitocat.li2': 'To W_i_dev, for sparking my curiosity about game programming and for their constant work promoting the role of women in the industry.',
    'mitocat.p6': 'I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I enjoyed creating it!',
    'mitocat.ia': 'Visually, AI has played an important role: it helped me create the characters, backgrounds and other graphic elements. When programming it has been more of a teacher, the one I turned to with my questions while learning Unity. The game\'s development is 100% mine: it was not done automatically with AI, as is the case with this website.',
    'feminist.meta.titulo': 'Feminist · Mireia Gutiérrez Águila',
    'feminist.meta.desc': 'Feminist: a protest and feminist video game for Android, made with Unreal Engine by Mireia Gutiérrez Águila.',
    'feminist.portada.alt': 'Feminist cover art: a young woman in a polka-dot headscarf, raised fist, on a yellow background',
    'feminist.p1': 'Feminist is a protest and feminist video game in which you can confront the structures of patriarchy, overcome obstacles loaded with inequality and transform your surroundings through social struggle and historical memory.',
    'feminist.p2': 'But you will not be alone: the great women of history will support you along the way, giving you their energy and wisdom to fill you with empowerment and keep moving forward. You can also discover the story of each of them, unlocking real accounts of pioneers, scientists, artists and leaders who changed the world.',
    'feminist.p3': 'Are you ready to rewrite history and raise your voice?',
    'feminist.ia': 'Visually, AI has played an important role: it helped me create the characters, backgrounds and other graphic elements. In development it has been more of a teacher, the one I turned to with my questions. The game\'s development is 100% mine: it was not done automatically with AI, as is the case with this website.',
